    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1978904653917213044",
      "url": "https://x.com/IPRTelangana/status/1978904653917213044",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/IPRTelangana/status/1978904653917213044",
      "text": "#TrafficAlert 🚦 | #TrafficAdvisory\n \nIn view of the *nomination processions for the 61–Jubilee Hills Assembly Bye-Elections* on **17.10.2025 (10 AM–4 PM)**, **moderate traffic congestion** is expected around **Yousufguda, Kotla Vijaya Bhaskar Reddy (KVBR) Indoor Stadium, and Krishna Nagar** due to processions/rallies by contesting candidates.\n \n🚫 *Avoid these routes if possible* 🚗 *Use alternate roads for a smoother commute*\n \n**Traffic Diversions (17.10.2025 | 10 AM–4 PM):**\n \n1.  Traffic from **Maitrivanam Junction → Yousufguda Basti/Rahamathnagar/Karmikanagar/Borabanda Bus Stop** will be diverted at **Yousufguda Basti → Krishnakanth Park → GTS Temple → Kalyan Nagar → Mothinagar → Borabanda Bus Stop**.\n \n2.  Traffic from **Maitrivanam Junction → Jubilee Hills Checkpost** via **Yousufguda Checkpost/Madhapur** will be diverted at **Yousufguda Basti → RBI Quarters → Krishna Nagar Junction → Jubilee Hills Checkpost**.\n \n3.  Traffic from **Jubilee Hills Checkpost/Venkatagiri → KVBR Stadium** will be diverted at **Krishna Nagar Junction → Srinagar Colony → Panjagutta**.\n \n4 Traffic from **Borabanda Bus Stop → Karmikanagar/Rahamathnagar/Yousufguda Checkpost** will be diverted at **Prime Garden Function Hall, Sri Ram Nagar X Roads → Midland Bakery → GTS Colony → Kalyan Nagar Junction → Vengalrao Nagar → Umesh Chandra Statue U-Turn → ICICI U-Turn → Maitrivanam Junction**.\n \n5. Traffic from **Panjagutta → Krishna Nagar via Srinagar Colony** will be diverted at **Srinagar Colony Park → MJ College Road → SNT Junction → NFCL**.\n \n📍**Parking Locations (for general public):**\n\n1.Metro Parking (Anakamma Thota     1 & 2), Yousufguda\n \n2. Savera Function Hall & Mahamood Function Hall – *4-wheelers only*\n\nCitizens are requested to note the above **traffic advisory** and **cooperate with #Hyderabad Traffic Police** for smooth regulation.\n \n#TrafficUpdate #Hyderabad #ByeElections #HYDTP #JubleeHills",
